            "block_content": "4. Notwithstanding the above, no employee exercising his/her rights under 18.2(A) (1) or (2) above shall be denied an opportunity to displace the least senior employee in the same title in the affected employee's facility, departmental unit, district, region, appointing authority, or statewide.",
